# Files present in web/dist that Cloudflare should NOT publish as static assets. Everything under
# web/public is copied into the build verbatim, which is right for the app's own files but also sweeps up
# the documentation that sits next to the bundled artwork. Serving those adds nothing and quietly exposes
# how the asset sets are organised.
#
# `_headers` is consumed by Cloudflare to build the response-header rules and is never served, so it needs
# no entry here.
**/README.md
